  {%- comment -%} ══════════ TECHNOLOGY ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="sc-section" id="sc-technology" aria-labelledby="sc-tech-heading">
    <div class="sc-container">
      <div class="sc-section-header center">
        <span class="sc-eyebrow">Understanding the Technology</span>
        <h2 id="sc-tech-heading">What Separates a Premium Massage Chair from Everything Else</h2>
        <p>The technology vocabulary that separates a $500 chair from a $9,000 one &mdash; and why each feature meaningfully impacts your daily experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-tech-grid">
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-4d">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Advanced Massage</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#129306;</span>
          <h3>4D Massage Technology</h3>
          <p>A <strong>4D massage arm</strong> moves in four dimensions &mdash; forward, backward, side to side, and variable speed &mdash; enabling rollers to replicate the nuanced pressure and release patterns of a skilled human therapist. You feel the difference immediately compared to 3D or 2D systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-body-scan">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Smart Technology</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128225;</span>
          <h3>Automatic Body Scan</h3>
          <p>Before every session, <strong>body scan technology</strong> maps your spinal length, shoulder width, and body curvature, calibrating roller positioning so the massage zones align precisely with your anatomy &mdash; not an averaged profile.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-zero-gravity">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Spinal Relief</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128640;</span>
          <h3>Zero Gravity Recline</h3>
          <p><strong>Zero gravity positioning</strong> elevates your legs above your heart &mdash; the neutral body position originally developed by NASA. Your spine decompresses naturally, and the massage penetrates more deeply at the same pressure settings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-ltrack">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Full Coverage</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128260;</span>
          <h3>L-Track vs. S-Track</h3>
          <p>An <strong>L-track</strong> extends the massage rail from the neck down through the seat to reach the glutes and hamstrings &mdash; critical for sciatic tension and hip flexor tightness. An <strong>S-track</strong> covers only the spine&rsquo;s natural curve. All elite brands here use L-track.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-air">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Full-Body Compression</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128168;</span>
          <h3>Air Compression Massage</h3>
          <p><strong>Air compression systems</strong> use inflatable chambers across the shoulders, arms, hips, calves and feet to apply rhythmic compression and release, promoting circulation and reducing muscle tension throughout the extremities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-heat">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Soothing Warmth</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#127777;&#65039;</span>
          <h3>Heat Therapy</h3>
          <p><strong>Heat therapy</strong> positioned along the lumbar region and calves loosens muscle tissue during massage, allowing rollers and air compression to work more effectively while adding a deeply soothing layer to every evening session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

