            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>4D refers to the massage arm&rsquo;s range of motion &mdash; forward, backward, side to side, and variable speed &mdash; allowing for a more human-like, nuanced massage. Zero gravity is the reclining position: your legs elevated above your heart, decompressing the spine. Many premium chairs in our Santa Clara showroom offer both features at the same time.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-6">
