            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>The right brand depends on your body, lifestyle, and priorities. OHCO is ideal if design and immersive luxury are paramount. Panasonic excels for therapeutic precision and back pain management. Positive Posture is perfect for daily comfort and restorative routines. D.Core is the choice for buyers who want Japanese-inspired refinement alongside genuine performance. Koyo offers excellent functionality and long-term reliability at accessible premium pricing. The only way to truly know is to visit us and try them.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
