            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Do I need to visit a showroom before buying a massage chair?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>You don&rsquo;t have to &mdash; but most customers who skip the showroom and buy online tell us they wish they hadn&rsquo;t. At $3,000 to $15,000+, a premium massage chair is a significant investment. Every person&rsquo;s body responds differently to different chairs. Visiting our Santa Clara showroom removes all guesswork and gives you complete confidence the moment you decide.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-9">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>What should I look for in a premium massage chair?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Key features to evaluate: track type (L-track for full-body coverage), massage arm dimension (4D for the most nuanced feel), automatic body scan precision, zero gravity recline positions, air compression coverage, heat therapy zones, and build quality. Our Santa Clara specialists will walk you through each feature in a way that connects directly to your body and lifestyle.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-10">
